      "text": "Can cache API calls. \nCan be used at geolocation level.\nGreat for super populae events.\n[Becomes less useful based on permutation \nof the search query or it has \nuser personalized recommendations]\n* say, it has lat, long (for location), it'll \nnever match in that case.",
